<report>
<title>Two independent proportions</title>
<p>Total 1 = @{n_1:round1},  response 1 = @{r_1:round1}<br />
Proportion 1 = @{prop_1:roundu}<br />
Total 2 = @{n_2:round1},  response 2 = @{r_2:round1}<br />
Proportion 2 = @{prop_2:roundu}</p>

<p>Proportion difference = @{prop_diff:roundu}</p>

<p><ci>Approximate (Miettinen) @{ci:round2}% confidence interval = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci></p>
<block name="exact2">

<p><pval>Exact two sided (mid) @{mp:pval}</pval></p>
</block>

<p>Standard error of proportion difference = @{se:roundu}<br />
Standard normal deviate (z) = @{z:roundu}</p>
<block name="approx2">
<p><pval>Approximate two sided @{z:zvalp2}</pval><br />
<pval>Approximate one sided @{z:zvalp1}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
